{"data":{"id":29814,"name":"ether.fi","symbol":"ETHFI","slug":"ether-fi-ethfi","category":"token","description":"ether.fi is a modern crypto neobank that replaces the traditional consumer bank. Users can save, grow, and spend their crypto through one connected experience. Common use cases include buying tokens, earning on crypto through vaults, sending money globally through fiat on and off ramps, and purchasing every day goods through a credit card.\n\nBehind that experience is crypto-native, non-custodial infrastructure that keeps users in control of their assets. Rather than separating investments from everyday finances, ether.fi makes it possible to put assets to work, access liquidity against them, and use them in daily life from the same platform.\n\nStake provides access to Ethereum staking while keeping positions liquid and usable. Liquid automates onchain strategies designed to generate variable yield across eligible assets. Cash supports card spending and payments. Trading, transfers, and collateralized borrowing bring additional flexibility, giving users more ways to manage and use their wealth without first selling their holdings.\n\nether.fi combines the technical foundation of a leading DeFi protocol with the simplicity and utility of a modern fintech platform. The result is a financial home for modern wealth: one place to grow it, move it, borrow against it, and use it—while remaining in control.","dateAdded":"2024-03-13T06:06:39.000Z","actualTimeStart":"2024-03-18T11:00:00.000Z","status":"active","isBn":1,"subStatus":"normal","notice":"","alertType":2,"alertLink":"","latestUpdateTime":"2026-10-19T06:45:00.000Z","watchCount":"79485","watchListRanking":471,"dateLaunched":"2023-02-27T00:00:00.000Z","latestAdded":false,"launchPrice":1.0,"tags":[{"slug":"defi","name":"DeFi","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":3},{"slug":"staking","name":"Staking","category":"CATEGORY","status":1,"priority":5},{"slug":"ethereum-ecosystem","name":"Ethereum Ecosystem